        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>地理试题</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#f2f2f2;\n    color:#111;\n    font-family:\"SimSun\",\"Songti SC\",\"STSong\",serif;\n  }\n  .page{\n    position:relative;\n    width:540px;\n    height:720px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    background:#fff;\n    padding-top:22px;\n    font-size:12px;\n    line-height:1.45;\n  }\n  .intro{\n    width:432px;\n    margin:0 auto 3px;\n    text-indent:2em;\n    letter-spacing:.15px;\n  }\n  .topic{\n    width:432px;\n    margin:0 auto 4px;\n    text-align:left;\n    font-weight:bold;\n  }\n  .mapbox{\n    position:relative;\n    width:375px;\n    height:297px;\n    margin:0 auto 1px;\n  }\n  .placeholder{\n    width:375px;\n    height:282px;\n    border:0;\n    position:relative;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .mapnum{\n    text-align:center;\n    height:15px;\n    font-size:11px;\n    line-height:15px;\n  }\n  .questions{\n    position:relative;\n    width:450px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    font-size:12px;\n    line-height:1.52;\n  }\n  .q{\n    position:relative;\n    margin:1px 0 2px;\n  }\n  .answers{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);\n    padding-left:17px;\n    margin-top:0;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  .answers span{display:block}\n  .q11 .answers{\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);\n    padding-left:17px;\n  }\n  .passage{\n    width:448px;\n    margin:4px auto 1px;\n    text-indent:2em;\n    line-height:1.45;\n  }\n  .section{\n    width:448px;\n    margin:1px auto 2px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n  }\n  .bottom{\n    width:450px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n  }\n  .hand{\n    position:absolute;\n    color:#35252a;\n    font-family:cursive;\n    font-size:19px;\n    font-weight:normal;\n    transform:rotate(-19deg);\n    opacity:.92;\n    z-index:5;\n  }\n  .h9{left:-5px;top:298px}\n  .h10{left:-6px;top:332px}\n  .h11{left:-7px;top:384px}\n  .h12{left:-4px;top:566px}\n  .h13{left:-4px;top:637px}\n  svg text{font-family:\"SimSun\",\"Songti SC\",serif;fill:#111}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"intro\">沙特阿拉伯第一条双线电气化高铁——麦麦高铁，是我国设计和承建的首条速度达到360千米/时的海外高铁，途经地区沙漠广布，高温缺水。图4为麦麦高铁位置示意图。据此完成9-11题。【认识世界区域+交通主题】</div>\n\n  <div class=\"mapbox\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"麦麦高铁位置示意图\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 375 282\" width=\"375\" height=\"282\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <defs>\n          <pattern id=\"hatch\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(-35)\">\n            <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"4\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\".55\"/>\n          </pattern>\n          <pattern id=\"dots\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n            <circle cx=\"1\" cy=\"1\" r=\".45\" fill=\"#777\"/>\n          </pattern>\n        </defs>\n\n        <rect x=\"4\" y=\"5\" width=\"370\" height=\"277\" fill=\"#fafafa\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <rect x=\"4\" y=\"5\" width=\"370\" height=\"277\" fill=\"url(#dots)\" opacity=\".45\"/>\n\n        <path d=\"M4 16 L170 16 L192 37 L249 57 L278 76 L374 70 L374 5 L4 5Z\" fill=\"url(#hatch)\" opacity=\".9\"/>\n        <path d=\"M4 222 L74 230 L92 282 L4 282Z\" fill=\"url(#hatch)\" opacity=\".9\"/>\n\n        <path d=\"M62 42 L84 42 L91 53 L86 70 L77 77 L75 95 L65 109 L60 126 L64 150 L77 171 L86 196 L98 224 L118 251 L143 270 L175 274 L195 267 L211 252 L231 233 L251 215 L267 195 L278 169 L273 150 L255 140 L238 129 L221 111 L204 98 L186 88 L170 80 L151 70 L129 63 L111 51 L97 37 L81 31Z\" fill=\"#aeb8a6\" stroke=\"#444\" stroke-width=\".8\"/>\n        <path d=\"M168 20 L183 27 L198 31 L210 39 L226 46 L239 54 L259 57 L271 68 L295 71 L306 82 L302 100 L283 102 L265 96 L245 96 L229 91 L214 85 L196 75 L183 69 L171 56 L161 47Z\" fill=\"#b1b9a4\" stroke=\"#444\" stroke-width=\".7\"/>\n        <path d=\"M275 104 L305 100 L323 105 L343 101 L358 104 L368 114 L365 145 L351 162 L336 173 L320 182 L303 184 L286 170 L277 154 L269 138Z\" fill=\"#b1b9a4\" stroke=\"#444\" stroke-width=\".7\"/>\n        <path d=\"M247 198 L279 193 L302 184 L322 185 L331 205 L321 225 L302 247 L284 257 L263 250 L252 234Z\" fill=\"#aeb8a6\" stroke=\"#444\" stroke-width=\".7\"/>\n\n        <path d=\"M67 49 L83 48 L91 58 L85 69 L78 76\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n        <path d=\"M89 76 L107 57 L127 54 L151 57 L171 68 L190 69\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n        <path d=\"M187 69 L211 74 L224 87 L234 91\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n        <path d=\"M232 94 L244 111 L255 119\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n        <path d=\"M254 120 L273 132 L289 145 L300 162 L300 181 L289 195 L266 203 L239 210 L210 220 L177 225 L143 223 L130 206\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n        <path d=\"M129 205 L120 194 L116 178 L106 166\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n\n        <line x1=\"4\" y1=\"51\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".55\"/>\n        <line x1=\"4\" y1=\"165\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".55\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/>\n        <line x1=\"4\" y1=\"207\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"207\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".55\"/>\n        <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"282\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".55\"/>\n        <line x1=\"212\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"212\" y2=\"282\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".55\"/>\n        <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"282\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".55\"/>\n\n        <text x=\"90\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"10\">40°E</text>\n        <text x=\"202\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"10\">50°E</text>\n        <text x=\"315\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"10\">60°E</text>\n        <text x=\"80\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"10\">40°E</text>\n        <text x=\"202\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"10\">50°E</text>\n        <text x=\"315\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"10\">60°E</text>\n        <text x=\"0\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\">30°N</text>\n        <text x=\"0\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\">20°N</text>\n        <text x=\"376\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"10\">30°N</text>\n        <text x=\"376\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"10\">20°N</text>\n\n        <text x=\"10\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"12\">地 中 海</text>\n        <text x=\"39\" y=\"121\" font-size=\"11\">红</text>\n        <text x=\"42\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"11\">海</text>\n        <text x=\"83\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"11\">海</text>\n        <text x=\"250\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"11\">波 斯 湾</text>\n        <text x=\"315\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"10\">北回归线</text>\n        <text x=\"126\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">沙 特 阿 拉 伯</text>\n        <text x=\"98\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"9\">麦地那</text>\n        <circle cx=\"101\" cy=\"119\" r=\"2.3\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n        <text x=\"99\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"9\">麦加</text>\n        <circle cx=\"105\" cy=\"153\" r=\"2.3\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n        <text x=\"177\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"10\">利雅得</text>\n        <circle cx=\"174\" cy=\"117\" r=\"2.3\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n        <text x=\"181\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"10\">叙</text>\n        <text x=\"178\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"10\">利</text>\n        <text x=\"202\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"10\">伊</text>\n        <text x=\"214\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"10\">拉</text>\n        <text x=\"225\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"10\">克</text>\n        <text x=\"288\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"10\">伊 朗</text>\n        <text x=\"242\" y=\"181\" font-size=\"10\">阿</text>\n        <text x=\"252\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"10\">联</text>\n        <text x=\"260\" y=\"198\" font-size=\"10\">酋</text>\n        <text x=\"278\" y=\"221\" font-size=\"10\">阿</text>\n        <text x=\"290\" y=\"229\" font-size=\"10\">曼</text>\n        <text x=\"162\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"10\">也 门</text>\n\n        <rect x=\"294\" y=\"146\" width=\"76\" height=\"116\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\".7\"/>\n        <text x=\"321\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\">图例</text>\n        <circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"170\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"#111\"/><text x=\"311\" y=\"173\" font-size=\"8\">首都</text>\n        <circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"181\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#111\"/><text x=\"311\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"8\">重要城市</text>\n        <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"191\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"191\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"311\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"8\">麦麦高铁</text>\n        <text x=\"300\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"8\">阴影区域</text>\n        <rect x=\"301\" y=\"209\" width=\"8\" height=\"6\" fill=\"url(#hatch)\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".3\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"8\">温带大陆性气候</text>\n        <rect x=\"301\" y=\"219\" width=\"8\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#aeb8a6\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".3\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"8\">热带沙漠气候</text>\n        <rect x=\"301\" y=\"229\" width=\"8\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#c6c6c6\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".3\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"8\">热带草原气候</text>\n        <rect x=\"301\" y=\"239\" width=\"8\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#eee\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\".3\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"245\" font-size=\"8\">地中海气候</text>\n        <line x1=\"302\" y1=\"252\" x2=\"342\" y2=\"252\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <line x1=\"302\" y1=\"249\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <line x1=\"322\" y1=\"249\" x2=\"322\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <line x1=\"342\" y1=\"249\" x2=\"342\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <text x=\"298\" y=\"261\" font-size=\"7\">0　150　300 千米</text>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mapnum\">图 4</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"questions\">\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      9．麦麦高铁经过地区主要属于\n      <div class=\"answers\">\n        <span>A．热带季风气候</span><span>B．热带沙漠气候</span><span>C．热带草原气候</span><span>D．热带雨林气候</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      10．修建麦麦高铁遇到的困难有<br>\n      <span style=\"padding-left:18px;\">①风沙侵袭　　②高寒缺氧　　　③高温缺水　　　④昼夜温差大</span>\n      <div class=\"answers\">\n        <span>A．①②③</span><span>B．②③④</span><span>C．①③④</span><span>D．①②④</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"q q11\">\n      11．麦麦高铁通车后，给当地带来的积极影响有<br>\n      <span style=\"padding-left:18px;\">①方便了人们出行　②促进了文化交流　③降低了能源运输成本　④带动了经济发展</span>\n      <div class=\"answers\">\n        <span>A．①②③</span><span>B．②③④</span><span>C．①②④</span><span>D．①③④</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"passage\">未来20年，中国客机需求量将持续增长。2023年4月，中法两国签署了总价值超过1300亿元人民币的民用飞机订单，法国空客集团将在中国增设工厂。据此完成12-13题。</div>\n  <div class=\"section\">【国际发展与合作主题】</div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom\">\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      12．中法两国签署飞机订单属于\n      <div class=\"answers\">\n        <span>A．文化合作</span><span>B．旅游合作</span><span>C．教育合作</span><span>D．经贸合作</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      13．法国空客集团在中国增设工厂的主要原因是中国<br>\n      <span style=\"padding-left:18px;\">①劳动力丰富　　　②技术水平高　　　③国家政策支持　　　④闲置土地充足</span>\n      <div class=\"answers\">\n        <span>A．①②③</span><span>B．②③④</span><span>C．①②④</span><span>D．①③④</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11px;margin-top:1px;\">地理试题　第3页（共8页）</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"hand h9\">B9</div>\n  <div class=\"hand h10\">D10</div>\n  <div class=\"hand h11\">C11</div>\n  <div class=\"hand h12\">D12</div>\n  <div class=\"hand h13\">A13</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
